    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/f8d52e6f1eab4954136f9c3d57b1e50d.avif?t=1750268297\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Step into a fast-paced PvP combat game that blends intense battles across various arenas and battlegrounds. Experience a unique combat system and feel clutch movements in a never-seen-before combinaison of aerial prowesses and ground abilities. Visit vibrant social hubs to meet with other players, craft powerful equipments, customize your build and queue up for your next match to climb through the ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join the Okubi Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Okubi is being developed by a passionate solo-dev. You can be part of its journey by joining our Discord server, where development is open, collaborative, and shaped by the community. Frequent playtests are organized, and your feedback is  welcome\u2014it helps drive real change. Come test, share, and help shape the future of Okubi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>GAMEPLAY, FEATURES AND MECHANICS!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong></i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HIGH-SKILL-CAP AERIAL AND GROUND COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Step into OKUBI\u2019s distinct combat experience, combining fluid aerial maneuvers with powerful ground techniques for a thrilling, responsive feel.\u00a0Easy to learn, hard to master. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/c03d09abe87f9be3b10bc8aca1a41b7e.poster.avif?t=1750268297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/c03d09abe87f9be3b10bc8aca1a41b7e.webm?t=1750268297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REWARDING ARENAS AND BATTLEGROUNDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the arena! Engage in intense 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and various team-based battlegrounds. Slay enemy players or complete challenges to claim mythic rewards! Ascend through ranked tiers and become the undisputed champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/6b02d3e1ee3f5664d6bb62685b8f19df.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMMERSIVE SOCIAL HUB EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet tons of other players in various Hubs where you can form parties, craft powerful equipment and partake in mini-games. Unlock more luxurious and convenient towns as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/b46be7135bdff22fb81b220efa3f990d.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and upgrade your character to adapt it's combat skills to your playstyle. Customize your weapons with dynamic buffs, adding unique trigger effects that enhance your character and increase strategic depth in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/123e042d5b1fc2e4961a27e2855f9bea.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ELEMENTAL ATTUNEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of the 5 Elements to define your combat style. Infuse your weapons with unique effects and unleash devastating abilities, turning every encounter into a test of skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/fb212af31a0308cc7c2734b1f2de0883.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROCEDURAL EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic gameplay in Okubi as the mysterious Y\u014dkai can spawn unpredictable events directly onto the battlefield, keeping you on your toes and adding an element of surprise to each match!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/960380db89035754feb2393e18c65103.poster.avif?t=1750268297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/960380db89035754feb2393e18c65103.webm?t=1750268297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/960380db89035754feb2393e18c65103.mp4?t=1750268297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Step into a fast-paced PvP combat game that blends intense battles across various arenas and battlegrounds. Experience a unique combat system and feel clutch movements in a never-seen-before combinaison of aerial prowesses and ground abilities. Visit vibrant social hubs to meet with other players, craft powerful equipments, customize your build and queue up for your next match to climb through the ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join the Okubi Community!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Okubi is being developed by a passionate solo-dev. You can be part of its journey by joining our Discord server, where development is open, collaborative, and shaped by the community. Frequent playtests are organized, and your feedback is  welcome\u2014it helps drive real change. Come test, share, and help shape the future of Okubi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i><strong>GAMEPLAY, FEATURES AND MECHANICS!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong></i></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HIGH-SKILL-CAP AERIAL AND GROUND COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Step into OKUBI\u2019s distinct combat experience, combining fluid aerial maneuvers with powerful ground techniques for a thrilling, responsive feel.\u00a0Easy to learn, hard to master. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/c03d09abe87f9be3b10bc8aca1a41b7e.poster.avif?t=1750268297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/c03d09abe87f9be3b10bc8aca1a41b7e.webm?t=1750268297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REWARDING ARENAS AND BATTLEGROUNDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the arena! Engage in intense 1v1, 2v2, 3v3, and various team-based battlegrounds. Slay enemy players or complete challenges to claim mythic rewards! Ascend through ranked tiers and become the undisputed champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/6b02d3e1ee3f5664d6bb62685b8f19df.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMMERSIVE SOCIAL HUB EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet tons of other players in various Hubs where you can form parties, craft powerful equipment and partake in mini-games. Unlock more luxurious and convenient towns as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/b46be7135bdff22fb81b220efa3f990d.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and upgrade your character to adapt it's combat skills to your playstyle. Customize your weapons with dynamic buffs, adding unique trigger effects that enhance your character and increase strategic depth in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/123e042d5b1fc2e4961a27e2855f9bea.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ELEMENTAL ATTUNEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of the 5 Elements to define your combat style. Infuse your weapons with unique effects and unleash devastating abilities, turning every encounter into a test of skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/fb212af31a0308cc7c2734b1f2de0883.avif?t=1750268297\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROCEDURAL EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic gameplay in Okubi as the mysterious Y\u014dkai can spawn unpredictable events directly onto the battlefield, keeping you on your toes and adding an element of surprise to each match!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/960380db89035754feb2393e18c65103.poster.avif?t=1750268297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/960380db89035754feb2393e18c65103.webm?t=1750268297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2118100/extras/960380db89035754feb2393e18c65103.mp4?t=1750268297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
